["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"My water heater is cooler than yours heat pump water heater dip tube anode rod demand response\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-technologyconn-热水器比你家冷-热泵热水器冬天只降室温-4-6-度/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/17b42c7feedd2fad-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">TechnologyConnections</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>热水器比你家冷：热泵热水器冬天只降室温 4-6 度</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">热泵热水器用 400W 电搬 1600W 热，夏天洗澡等于免费制冷；冬天它只让所在房间降 4-6 度，因为烧一缸水耗的热量只够暖气烧 40 分钟。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">热泵</span><span class=\"tag\">电气化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Dario Defends Himself, Datacenter Panic, AI Doomer Trap, Senate Toss-Up harness SRO (self-regulatory organization) RSI (recursive self-improvement) interlocking directorates DSA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-allin-反数据中心浪潮的燃料不是缺水缺电-是万亿富翁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0d37432d346f02be-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>开源禁令要来了：先立机构，再写进法律，最后以公平为名关掉开源</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sacks 给出了开源禁令的三步落地路径：先立机构、再写进法律、最后以「标准应平等适用」的名义关掉开源；Chamath 则认为真正的政治燃料是选民对两个人即将成为万亿富翁的反感，跟 AI 安全和水电无关。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">监管俘获</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Patient Zero healthy carrier spillover molecular clock cut hunter SIV\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-radiolab-零号病人不是起点-而是被选中的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/66ac5d70f1e2077a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">51:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Radiolab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>零号病人不是源头，是社会需要的替罪羊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">从伤寒玛丽到 HIV 再到高五手势，所谓源头都是人类需要的叙事；真相是一个拼图，而我们只想要焦点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零号病人</span><span class=\"tag\">伤寒玛丽</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Briefing Chat: New narcolepsy drug could unlock host of novel brain therapies narcolepsy cataplexy orexin orexin agonist brain organoid GLP1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-naturepod-缺失的食欲素被补上-发作性睡病有了治本药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/52b8ecfabe6e81c0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">12:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>补上缺失的食欲素：发作性睡病有了治本药，还是大脑版 GLP-1</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FDA 批准首个 orexin 激动剂，补上 type 1 发作性睡病缺失的食欲素，而不是只治症状；它可能成为「大脑版 GLP-1」。另一边，脑类器官首次活过五年，能用于晚发脑病研究。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">发作性睡病</span><span class=\"tag\">食欲素</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"E248 从 QQ 空间到苹果设计大奖：一个非典型设计师的成长之路 Flashcard Feature phone Quality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-zhixing-没得选的野路子-如何撞出苹果设计大奖/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f7a02aabb852635f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒馆</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>初中学历不会画画，怎么做出苹果设计大奖</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一个初中学历、不会画画的野路子，靠反复撞南墙和不放过『不舒服』的感受，做出中国首款获苹果设计大奖的非游戏App。品味不是天赋，是长期训练出的习惯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">设计</span><span class=\"tag\">审美</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Microsoft&#x27;s Deputy CISO on Securing AI Agents OpenClaw air-gapped CISO harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-a16z-ai-智能体像喝了酒的实习生-安全团队得先学会说-可以/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>AI 智能体像喝了酒的实习生，安全团队得先学会说「可以」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能体不可预测、会乱来，但管它靠的不是新魔法，而是给身份、划边界、留日志这些老办法——只是要快得多。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Hugging Face Journal Club: Training AI Scientists to Replicate Research rubric judge reward hacking GRPO ring attention\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-huggingface-小模型指挥大模型-ai-科学家复现论文超过-claude/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f339a70c3ef285af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">35:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Hugging Face</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>小模型指挥大模型：AI 科学家复现论文超过 Claude</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">微调一个小模型去调用更强的模型当工具，复现论文结果时反而比 Claude 和 Codex 更可靠——靠的是带权重的奖励分配和给工具调用加权。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">AI科学家</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Is a Museum Just a Trophy Case? (Update) Benin Bronzes Deaccession Oba Punitive expedition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-freakonomics-归还贝宁青铜器不是终点-是道德选择的开端/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2668c2a741e435d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">52:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>归还贝宁青铜器：不是该不该还，是还给谁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">归还被掠夺文物成了时代正确，但贝宁青铜器的「还给谁」比「该不该还」更难回答：法国和德国在竞赛，英国在装死，尼日利亚内部有三个势力在争夺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">归还</span><span class=\"tag\">博物馆</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The China Shock 2.0 three red lines reciprocal interdependence rare earths\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-ezra-中国冲击2-0-国家资本正在改写全球产业版图/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>中国冲击2.0：不是廉价货，是补贴碾压全球产业</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">与1.0不同，中国冲击2.0是房地产崩盘后国家资本转向前沿制造，以补贴和产能挤压全球，AI 可能成为下一个战场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">贸易战</span><span class=\"tag\">产业政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Here&#x27;s the Talk to Have Before Your Teen&#x27;s First Party binge drinking fear-based parenting buddy system\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-raisinggh-孩子第一次派对前-先谈好暗号和退出计划/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bcdac3a8011c0549-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">29:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>孩子第一次派对前，先谈好暗号和退出计划</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究显示越早接触酒精越容易走向重度使用，所以「我喝你也喝、随时打给我」是错的；正确做法是明确禁止，同时给一个零惩罚的暗号接人方案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亲子沟通</span><span class=\"tag\">青少年</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"How memory changes you episodic memory semantic memory schema cognitive dissonance collective memory highly superior autobiographical memory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-grayarea-记忆不是备份而是一幅画-每次回忆都在改写自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/541159f7de86a65c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>记忆不是备份而是画：每次回忆都在改写自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">记忆的功能不是存档过去，而是为当下和未来提供资源；回忆每次都在重构叙事，集体记忆更会被权力与情绪塑造。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神经科学</span><span class=\"tag\">记忆机制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jasmine Sun on What the AI Industry Got Wrong About the Public Backlash closed loop / open loop cooling exclusionary zoning reward hacking salience NIMBY\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-oddlots-ai-行业赌错了民意爆点-不是失业-是数据中心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">51:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>AI 行业防了三年失业反弹，引爆点却是数据中心</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 公司花三年准备失业冲击的公关，结果反弹从数据中心和儿童安全这两个没设防的地方爆发；与此同时地方谈判的议价权已在两年内从社区求企业翻转为企业求社区。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Lessons from the American Civil War Fabian strategy cordon defense breech loader Spencer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-chinatalk-南方只需要不输-却把仗打成了必须赢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3b20b71b2c9ea881-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>南方只需要不输，却把仗打成了必须赢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">邦联的正确胜利理论是让北方觉得继续打不值得，但萨姆特堡和进军肯塔基把中立州推给了联邦，等于自己毁掉了这套理论。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">组织设计</span><span class=\"tag\">技术采纳</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Akhenaten and Nefertiti: religious revolution in ancient Egypt Aten Amarna Akhenaten Nefertiti\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-youdead-阿吞一神教的二十年-阿肯那顿与纳芙蒂蒂被除名/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0073e2208d79c2f3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">58:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">You&#x27;re Dead to Me</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>独尊太阳神二十年：法老死后被从历史中除名</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">阿肯那顿用二十年独尊太阳圆盘阿吞、迁都沙漠新城，试图抹掉旧神；他死后宗教被逆转，他和可能的继任者纳芙蒂蒂双双从法老名录中被除名。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古埃及</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教革命</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The DeLorean Saga: Fraud, Drugs and Marty McFly&#x27;s Car - with Business History gull-wing doors entrapment disciplined pluralism snowcat\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-cautionary-delorean-案-工业政策的核心是竞争纪律/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">49:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>DeLorean 案：产业政策别押注单一企业</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeLorean 靠英国政府约一亿美元补贴建厂，却滑向 1800 万美元诈骗和 FBI 可卡因设局。产业政策真正的教训不是要不要补贴，而是保持多家竞争、用出口市场当纪律，别押注单一企业。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车产业</span><span class=\"tag\">工业政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Taste is the new programming language (w/ Astrocade CEO Amir Sadeghian) | AI Basics wish post-training creator fund prosumer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-twist-品味才是-ai-生成游戏的真壁垒/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c4b178bff0f13dbf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">21:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>AI 生成游戏不缺技术，缺的是人肉调参的品味</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 能把一句话变成可玩的游戏，但真正的壁垒不是生成，而是人的品味和手工调参：LLM 只会复制、不会创新，编辑器也是它替用户生成的第二件作品。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI生成游戏</span><span class=\"tag\">消费级AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"China&#x27;s Fiery Incinerator Boom Moving Grate Circulating Fluidized Bed BOT Decide-Announce-Defend\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-asianometry-六年七百座焚烧厂-补贴撑起的行业狂潮/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/50671d996bbd2339-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>焚烧厂狂潮不是环保胜利，是电价补贴算出来的生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2012年一项电价补贴政策让焚烧发电从赔钱生意变成有利可图的行业，中国用六年建了近700座焚烧厂，如今却面临产能过剩、平均利用率不到六成的问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">垂直行业</span><span class=\"tag\">产业政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"296 韩国医美体验记：不管医美水有多深 这片产业海是真蓝 medical tourism specialist doctor work holiday visa\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-eastasia-韩国医美产业蓝海背后-中国卡在政策摇摆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86e8f4dd3d50b302-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">东亚观察局</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>韩国医美便宜到退税取消仍比中国划算，中国卡在政策暧昧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">韩国医美已形成大众化、观光化产业，价格不透明但整体便宜；中国有需求无政策，市场混乱，钱都让韩国赚了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医美</span><span class=\"tag\">韩国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Owain Evans on accidentally training AI models to be evil Emergent misalignment Activation oracle Alignment faking Shoggoth Persona vector\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-eightythousand-训练模型变邪恶-涌现性错位比想象中更危险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/487d3defa6dd5f72-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">2:15:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>少量恶意数据微调，模型竟涌现出邪恶人格</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">少量恶意数据微调就能让模型涌现出广泛错位行为，甚至形成邪恶人格；激活预言机是检测内部不良意图的新工具，但对齐现状仍不乐观。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">涌现性错位</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Global Networks Are Reshaping Startup Success borderless founder local luminary preferential attachment hacker house fraud as a stack\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-a16z-ai-让创业更民主-却把震中更集中到湾区/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>AI 让创业更民主，却把震中更集中到湾区</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 把技术分发到全世界，却把最快的变化集中回湾区；borderless founder 的杠杆不是本地知识，而是能跨国调动的侨民网络。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">全球化</span><span class=\"tag\">创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"From Restoring Sight to Reimagining the Brain, with Max Hodak form vision retinal prosthesis biohybrid neural interface platonic representation hypothesis connectomics substrate independence\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-nopriors-大脑是计算机-不是哲学立场-是绕开生物学的商业路线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f479aa2affd66cb2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">31:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>大脑是计算机不是哲学，是绕开药物的商业路线</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Max Hodak 的判断是：把大脑当计算机来接线，能拿到小分子药物拿不到的效应量和可迭代性——Prima 视网膜假体已在欧洲获批销售，但视野像透过吸管、只有黑白。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">BCI</span><span class=\"tag\">医疗器械</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Biggest Myths in Personal Finance | Rational Reminder 423 CAPE block bootstrap SPIVA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-rationalreminder-年轻时拼命存钱-是在从穷的自己手里抢钱给富的自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/56aec8525b339b0a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>年轻时拼命存钱，是在从穷的自己手里抢钱给富的自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">个人理财里最流行的几条铁律——趁年轻多存、股息贡献四成回报、指数基金只给平均、债券现金更安全——大多把因果搞反了。真正决定结果的不是规则，是你能不能拿得住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人理财</span><span class=\"tag\">指数基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The True Story of Why Immigration Agents Raided a Chicago Apartment Building BORTAC fast roping voluntary departure Tren de Aragua\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-papertrail-芝加哥突袭-政府说抓了恐怖分子-法庭上一次都没说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/768993b6167a32a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">41:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>芝加哥突袭：政府说抓了恐怖分子，法庭上一次都没说</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一场动用黑鹰直升机、BORTAC 和 FBI 的反恐式突袭，最终没有一个人被刑事起诉，逮捕记录里连 Tren de Aragua 这个词都没出现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">移民执法</span><span class=\"tag\">调查报道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Q&amp;A: What should I do if my child has intrusive thoughts? PANS/PANDAS intrusive thoughts ego dystonic sticky thinking boss back SPACE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-secureattach-孩子反复问同一个问题-可能不是好奇是侵入性思维/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">33:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>孩子反复问同一个问题，可能不是好奇是侵入性思维</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">侵入性思维的关键特征是「自我不协调」——孩子觉得这个念头不是自己，并为此羞耻。安慰只能带来短暂缓解，真正有效的是帮孩子把念头和自己分开，然后「怼回去」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">OCD</span>\n</div></div></a>"]